{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdtvGQqB3iV4tiZWj64i2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Action Plan\n\n1. **Call `payments.provider_status()`** immediately to determine if the provider is alive and responsive. This is safe and will tell us if cold-start is still in progress.\n\n2. **Call `payments.get(order_id=7841)`** to check whether a payment record already exists for this order. This reveals whether the original submit actually succeeded before timing out.\n\n3. **Decide based on results:**\n   - If `get()` shows a payment exists → **do not resubmit**. The original call succeeded; the timeout was only in the response path.\n   - If `get()` shows no payment AND provider is healthy → **resubmit `payments.submit()`** after a short delay, as this was a cold-start timeout with no side effect.\n   - If `get()` shows no payment AND provider is unhealthy/still starting → **wait and retry the status check** before resubmitting.\n\n4. **Do not blindly resubmit immediately.** The read-only checks first to avoid duplicate charges.\n\n**Explicit statement:** Resubmit `payments.submit()` only after confirming via `payments.get()` that no payment record exists for order 7841."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":260,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":281,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
